header = "TERMINAL 01  //  RESIDENT LOG"
text = "[b]ENTRY 0001[/b]
Placeholder log text. This page exists to prove that a terminal can show readable text on its screen; the real words come later.

The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. 0123456789. Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs.
避難所 第三区画 — かなとカナの試験行。

